tions."},"1637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active CA with an available key. If one does not exist yet, follow Create your first CA."},"1638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"An active end-entity certificate from that CA whose `Common Name` is exactly `device-001`, together with its private key. Follow Issue and verify a certificate to obtain and check both."},"1639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#before-you-begin","content":"The identifier `device-001` available in the inventory. If you already used it, choose another and issue the certificate with that same `Common Name`."},"1640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"A DMS must exist before registering the device. If you already have a suitable one, check its CA and note its identifier; to create one:"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Open the DMS inventory and its creation action. Assign a recognizable name, such as `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1642":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Enrollment CA**, select the CA that issued `device.crt`."},"1643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In **Registration Mode**, select `PRE_REGISTRATION` for the path that starts with explicit registration."},"1644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"In the authentication section, enable **Require client certificate** and leave **Call external webhook** off. Under **Require client certificate**, add the CA whose initial certificates you will accept to **Validation CAs**; for this evaluation, it can be the same CA. Keep **Verify CSR Signature** enabled and leave **Enable server-side key generation** off if you will not use it."},"1645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepare-the-dms","content":"Review renewal and trust distri