nzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+ (solo para el modo predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`); para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu, pero solo para el modo predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`. En ese modo el chart renderiza sus recursos de Issuer self-signed y Certificate CA tanto si `tls.certManagerOptions.clusterIssuer` está definido como si no, por lo que cert-manager sigue siendo un requisito. Con `tls.type: external`, el chart no renderiza recursos de cert-manager y el Gateway termina el TLS con un Secret existente que tú proporcionas."},"224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si Keycloak es externo y ya tiene una URL accesible, apunta la configuración OIDC hacia él y omite la entrada `/auth` de `gateway.extraRouting`."},"227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"Crea un Secret con `tls.crt` y `tls.key` y referéncialo. El Secret debe existir antes de instalar: en modo `external` el chart no renderiza recursos de cert-manager ni crea nunca este Secret."},"228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No existe un superusuario implícito. Crea en el proveedor OIDC el rol o grupo esperado por `services.authz.bootstrap` y asígnalo al menos a un administrador antes de exponer Lamassu."},"229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El job de pre-install y pre-upgrade aplica el bootstrap de forma idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade los grants que falten."},"230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada. Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo del bootstrap, nadie podrá administrar la PKI."},"231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para conocer el modelo de principales y políticas."},"232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","con