yment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu es un **chart de aplicación**, no un chart de bootstrap del clúster. Crea los recursos Kubernetes que ejecutan y configuran Lamassu, pero espera que ya existan los servicios de plataforma de los que dependen."},"338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Área"},"339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu proporciona"},"340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Tú proporcionas"},"341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Aplicaciones Lamassu"},"342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Deployments y StatefulSets para la UI y las APIs, Services internos, ConfigMaps, una ServiceAccount y HPA/PDB opcionales"},"343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-23","pag