g","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"En una instalación nueva, confirma que el Job de migración terminó. Ese Job crea esquemas, migra authz, precarga políticas y provisiona los principales definidos en services.authz.bootstrap."},"415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"La autorización externa falla cerrada por defecto. Si authz no está disponible, las rutas protegidas se bloquean."},"416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Localiza el pod y Service de authz."},"417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba /health, logs y conexión a su base de datos."},"418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Verifica el DNS y puerto configurados en externalAuthorization."},"419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba que la ruta del check es /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"No cambies a failOpen: true como solución permanente: permitiría tráfico sin autorización durante la caída."},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Revisa primero kubectl describe pod. Las causas habituales son:"},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"credenciales o DNS incorrectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"volumen persistente sin enlazar;"},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"imagen inaccesible o política de pull incorrecta;"},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"configuración inválida del motor criptográfico;"},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"límites de CPU o memoria demasiado bajos;"},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"migración previa incompleta."},"428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los valores genéricos solicitan 100 mCPU y 128 MiB y limitan a 500 mCPU y 512 MiB. Ajusta por servicio cuando haya OOMKills, throttling o arranques lentos."},"429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los motores KMS basados en filesystem y el almacenamiento local de VA utilizan volúmenes de acceso exclusivo. Mantén una réplica o migra a backends compartidos antes de habilitar autoscaling."},"430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Las llamadas internas ahora fallan rápido en lugar de bloquearse para los clientes cubiertos por Proxy de salida: los intentos de conexión agotan el tiempo tras 30 segundos y los handshakes TLS tras 10 segundos. El conector del motor de autorización mantiene su propio transporte sin estos timeouts de conexión ni de handshake TLS; solo su timeout global de petición de 30 segundos acota cada llamada. Si un proxy de salida gestiona el tráfico de salida del clúster, comprueba las variables de entorno `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` y `NO_PROXY` del pod e incluye los nombres de servicio internos en `NO_PROXY`."},"431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos de dominio y auditoría dependen del publisher del bus:"},"432":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"verifica que esté habilitado en el servicio emisor;"},"433":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"comprueba conectividad y credenciales AMQP;"},"434":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"revisa exchange, routing key, colas y consumidores;"},"435":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"inspecciona dead-letter queues;"},"436":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"alerta sobre colas durables huérfanas y crecimiento de backlog."},"437":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/deplo