trar DMS, dispositivos y la asociación de certificados."},"1620":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con clave disponible. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"1621":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un certificado final activo de esa CA cuyo `Common Name` sea exactamente `device-001`, con su clave privada. Sigue Emite y verifica un certificado para obtener y comprobar ambos."},"1622":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador `device-001` libre en el inventario. Si ya lo usaste, elige otro y emite el certificado con ese mismo `Common Name`."},"1623":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Un DMS debe existir antes de registrar el dispositivo. Si ya tienes uno adecuado, comprueba su CA y anota su identificador; si necesitas crearlo:"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Abre el inventario de DMS y la acción de creación. Asigna un nombre reconocible, como `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1625":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Enrollment CA**, selecciona la CA que emitió `device.crt`."},"1626":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Registration Mode**, selecciona `PRE_REGISTRATION` para el recorrido que comienza con un alta explícita."},"1627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En la sección de autenticación, activa **Require client certificate** y deja **Call external webhook** desactivado. Bajo **Require client certificate**, añade a **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás; para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deja **Enable server-side key generation** desactivado si no lo vas a utilizar."},"1628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Revisa los ajustes de renovación y distribución de confianza con la guía DMS, guarda el servicio y anota su identificador."},"1629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Vuelve a abrir el DMS y confirma que la CA de enrolamiento es la prevista y que el servicio aparece en el inventario."},"1630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Estos ajustes preparan la política DMS. Los pasos siguientes realizan el alta y la asignación desde la consola; no envían una solicitud EST ni prueban la admisión por ese protocolo."},"1631":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices** y la acción de registro. Completa:"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1633":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: el DMS que acabas de preparar; la etiqueta identifica al servicio que cumple el rol de autoridad de registro."},"1634":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional."},"1635":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Confirma el registro."},"1636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo. Debe aparecer en **No Identity** y mostrar el DMS propietario seleccionado."},"1637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"El registro crea la entrada de inventario; el certificado todavía debe asociarse."},"1638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/pla