o-esperado","content":"Comprobación"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Resultado"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Dispositivo"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"`device-001` aparece en el inventario con el DMS previsto."},"1646":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Identidad actual"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"El certificado asociado coincide con el que verificaste en PKI."},"1648":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Historial"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"La emisión asociada aparece con su número de serie y fechas."},"1650":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Clave y certificado"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Dispones de la pareja comprobada para instalarla en el dispositivo."},"1652":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si el DMS no puede seleccionarse, confirma su creación y tus permisos de lectura."},"1653":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si no aparece un certificado elegible, comprueba que su `Common Name` coincide exactamente con el `Device ID`, está activo y lo emitió la CA prevista."},"1654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si falla la asignación, revisa los permisos y el diagnóstico de la operación antes de repetirla. Vuelve a consultar el dispositivo y su historial para conocer el resultado persistido."},"1655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si aparece un estado relacionado con vencimiento o renovación, comprueba las fechas del certificado y los umbrales del DMS en Dispositivos e identidades."},"1656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Continúa con DMS y EST para que el dispositivo solicite y renueve sus certificados. Prepara la confianza del servidor, la credencial inicial y las políticas de cada operación antes de implementar el cliente."},"1657":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Para un recorrido desde el cliente hasta mTLS, sigue Enrola y conecta tu primer dispositivo con un ID nuevo."},"1658":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Para utilizar la identidad en AWS IoT Core, prepara también la confianza y los permisos del destino. Comprueba la conexión desde el dispositivo después de instalar la clave, el certificado y la cadena necesarios."},"1659":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","type":"page","content":"Plataforma Lamassu IoT","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","content":"Construye una PKI y aplica sus certificados al ciclo de vida de tus dispositivos."},"1661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"Empieza aquí"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Elige tu recorrido"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"Arquitectura de un vistazo"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-43/es/platform/overview","type":"